  "job_B9.2.5_20251003_114956": {
    "chunk_text": "ul wear\u00f0 gefliemed on Etruria \u00fe\u00e6m lande. \u00dea com Furius, o\u00feer consul, him to fultume, & sige h\u00e6fde, & hie si\u00fe\u00fean \u00fe\u00e6t land eall aweston. \u00dea \u00fea Lucius Ualerius & Flaccus Marcus w\u00e6ron consulas, \u00fea ongon Antiochus, Sira cyning, On \u00fe\u00e6re tide bebudan Romane \u00fe\u00e6t mon Hannibal Cartaina cyning gefenge, & hiene si\u00fe\u00fean to \u00dea he \u00fe\u00e6t hierde, \u00fea fleah he to Antiochuse. Sira cyninge, \u00fe\u00e6r he on tweogendlican onbide w\u00e6s hw\u00e6\u00f0er he wi\u00f0 Romanum winnan dorste, Ac hiene Hannibal aspon \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fe\u00e6t gewin leng ne ongan. \u00dea sendon Romane Scipian Affricanus hiera \u00e6rendracan to Antiochuse. \u00dea het he Hannibal \u00fe\u00e6t he wi\u00f0 \u00fea \u00e6rendracan spr\u00e6ce, & him geandwyrde. \u00dea hie nanre sibbe ne gewear\u00f0, \u00fea com \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Scipia se consul mid Clafrione, o\u00ferum \u00de\u00e6s on \u00f0\u00e6m \u00e6fterran gere gefeaht Scipia wi\u00f0 Hannibal ute on s\u00e6, & sige h\u00e6fde. \u00dea Antiochus \u00fe\u00e6t gehierde, \u00fea b\u00e6d he Scipian fri\u00fees, & him his sunu ham onsende, se w\u00e6s on On \u00fe\u00e6re firran Ispanie forwear\u00f0 Emilius se consul mid eallum his folce from Lusitaniam \u00fe\u00e6re On \u00fe\u00e6m dagum forwear\u00f0 Lucius Beuius se consul mid eallum his folce from Etusci \u00fe\u00e6m \u00c6fter \u00f0\u00e6m Fuluius se consul for mid firde on Crece to \u00fe\u00e6m beorgum \u00fee mon Olimphus h\u00e6t. \u00dea w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6s folces fela on an f\u00e6sten o\u00feflogen.",
